OL,3,GNEWSADad who shook baby has jail term
OL,4,Aincreased
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father who left his baby son
OL,7,Fpermanently disabled after shaking him
OL,8,Fhas had his jail term increased from
OL,9,Ffour to six years.
OL,11,FChristopher Yates had consumed cocaine
OL,12,Fand 11 pints of lager before he shook
OL,13,Fhis six-month-old son with the force of
OL,14,Fa "high velocity car accident," causing
OL,15,Fsevere brain injury, blindness and a
OL,16,Flikely inability to learn to walk.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
