OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADad who shook baby has jail term
OL,4,Aincreased
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 30-year-old from Gateshead admitted
OL,7,Fcausing a child to suffer serious
OL,8,Fphysical harm and was jailed for four
OL,9,Fyears at Newcastle Crown Court in July,
OL,10,Fbut the Solicitor General referred the
OL,11,Fsentence to the Court of Appeal.
OL,13,FLady Chief Justice Baroness Carr said:
OL,14,F"The sentence imposed by the judge was
OL,15,Fnot only lenient but unduly so."
